.nh
.TH "ORBIT" "1" "Aug 2026" "Orbit Developer Platform" "Orbit Platform Manual"

.SH NAME
.PP
orbit-update - Unified workspace update (CLI, git branches, migrations, and env validation)


.SH SYNOPSIS
.PP
\fBorbit update [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Performs a full workspace synchronization and verification:
  1. Checks for Orbit CLI updates
  2. Synchronizes all clean default git branches from origin
  3. Executes pending workspace migrations (.orbit/migrations.json)
  4. Validates project .env files against .env.schema.yaml contracts


.SH OPTIONS
.PP
\fB--concurrency\fP=4
	Concurrent git sync workers

.PP
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for update

.PP
\fB--manifest\fP=""
	Path to workspace.yaml (default: /workspace.yaml)

.PP
\fB--skip-env\fP[=false]
	Skip environment validation

.PP
\fB--skip-migrate\fP[=false]
	Skip workspace migrations

.PP
\fB--skip-selfupdate\fP[=false]
	Skip CLI update check

.PP
\fB--skip-sync\fP[=false]
	Skip workspace git sync


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
.PP
\fB--config\fP=""
	Custom path to Orbit CLI configuration file


.SH SEE ALSO
.PP
\fBorbit(1)\fP
